%   The document is then considered to be under temporary embargo, and
%   the dates replace the |__START__| and |__END__| placeholders of the
%   |embargotempbama| or |embargotempphd| dictionary keys
%   (see Section~\ref{S:usage:langdateloc:dict}).
%   This message is then printed using the |\@embargotempwithdates| macro,
%   which interacts with the current document language.
