% and the odd pages show it in the left footer.
% The frontmatter of a one-sided document simply shows the page number
% in the right footer.
% No header line is drawn for the frontmatter.
% For the mainmatter, the chapter marks are formatted as, e.g.,
% ``1. Chapter title''.
